 <HI REND="ITALIC">gentili populo,</HI>  I.</P> 

 <P COM="0952">353. Similaginis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">farinae, similae,</HI>  Mar.—Lascivire,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">lasciviam facere in suis carminibus.</HI> —Choris,  <HI REND="ITALIC">cantibus.</HI> —Esse,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">edere, manducare, comedisse, ab edo,</HI>  Iso.</P> 

 <P COM="0952">354. Fermentati,  <HI REND="ITALIC">antiqui, corrupti,</HI>  Iso.</P> 

