 <P COM="1030">268. Sutilibus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia ex gemma consuantur filo argenteo,
aut aureo,</HI>  I.</P></NOTE> <NOTE TYPE="Commentarius" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="1029"><COL N="1029C"></COL> <P COM="1029">240. Apoth. vers. 539 etiam legitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">exstirpata,</HI>  et
lib. II adversus Sym. vers. 1039,  <HI REND="ITALIC">exstirpamus.</HI>  Salmasius
pag. 284 in Trebellium ait in vetustissimo libro
Prudentii a se repertum  <HI REND="ITALIC">stirpare</HI>  pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">exstirpare,</HI>  ut in
optimis Ciceronis exemplaribus Victorius invenit
 <HI REND="ITALIC">scanduit</HI>  pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">exscanduit.</HI>  Sed in Apoth. et II in Sym.
legi debet  <HI REND="ITALIC">exstirpare.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="1029">241. Descriptio amnis torrentis apud poetas Lucretium,
Virgilium, Claudianum, Ovidium passim occurrit.</P> 

